<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "システム音\The_Lampe.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>Thank you for your hard work, <VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">-sama. You have reached the fourth ending of the True Jusatsu Arc.<PG>
For my sake, Natsumi kept on supporting me devotedly, even as she was worn to tatters.<PG>
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\立木三日目閉じ.gal" "REPEAT" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
Once again, I was made keenly aware of how much Natsumi meant to me.<PG>
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\春花悲しい.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
Natsumi...<PG>
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\立木三日目閉じ.gal" "REPEAT" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
Forgive me. Let us sort out the information gained in this scenario.<PG>
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\春花通常.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
It was a very interesting scenario. It can be treated without using falsificaso.<PG>
And to think it can be cured through proper medical treatment...<PG>
Also, once a person is driven by murderous intent, the body moves on its own, even without consciousness.<PG>
In other words, should we think that someone is taking over those who have become green-eyed?<PG>
It seems certain, then, that Droga is not merely a drug that boosts physical ability.<PG>
Now, there is still a long way to go. Let us proceed to the next scenario.<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
